WEBVTT

00:00:01.130 --> 00:00:04.160
Yoshimori and Kagemiya were
in the stronghold of the Kokuboro.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:06.870
The two of them were
chasing Kaguro,

00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:08.460
the one that killed Shishio.

00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:13.070
Tokine was also running
around the castle,

00:00:13.110 --> 00:00:14.940
in search of Yoshimori.

00:00:19.850 --> 00:00:23.180
In another location
unknown to those three,

00:00:23.180 --> 00:00:25.410
Matsudo Heisuke had
a battle to the death

00:00:25.450 --> 00:00:27.850
with Shiranuma,
also known as "Byaku."

00:00:28.720 --> 00:00:32.680
With Kagami's help, Matsudo managed
to obtain victory over Byaku.

00:00:33.530 --> 00:00:36.190
So an old score,
which began 50 years ago,

00:00:36.230 --> 00:00:37.890
had finally been settled.

00:00:48.210 --> 00:00:51.200
The worm is out of me.
Did something happen to Byaku?

00:00:52.680 --> 00:00:54.250
Whatever happened...

00:00:54.250 --> 00:00:57.220
there is nothing
to keep me here.

00:00:58.650 --> 00:01:00.660
Now that Byaku is gone,

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:03.320
the Kokuboro has weakened and
is being thrown deeper into chaos.

00:01:04.290 --> 00:01:09.060
After parting with Yoshimori,
Kagemiya met Tokine by chance.

00:01:09.830 --> 00:01:11.130
Yoshimori!

00:01:19.440 --> 00:01:24.710
The dangerous forest invites me
It's showtime again tonight

00:01:24.710 --> 00:01:26.580
(Ayakashi NIGHT)

00:01:26.580 --> 00:01:31.790
Everyone's rampaging
with all their strength

00:01:31.790 --> 00:01:33.690
(Fighting late into the night)

00:01:34.190 --> 00:01:37.130
Drive away all hesitation

00:01:37.130 --> 00:01:41.530
Wanna take them on? Yeah

00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:45.070
I will protect you
(No matter what)

00:01:45.070 --> 00:01:48.400
I will protect you, that's all
(that's all I want)

00:01:48.400 --> 00:01:54.070
Goodbye to the days
when all I'd do was cry

00:01:56.380 --> 00:01:58.570
Sha la la la la...

00:01:59.910 --> 00:02:04.990
I hold words in my heart
that I'd like to say

00:02:04.990 --> 00:02:06.960
(Secret romance)

00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:12.160
Standing in front of me is someone
I don't want to lose

00:02:12.160 --> 00:02:13.920
(A strange distance)

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:20.770
I can't stand watching
people get hurt anymore

00:02:20.840 --> 00:02:21.840
Yeah

00:02:21.840 --> 00:02:25.310
I wanna be your knight
(I wanna be strong)

00:02:25.310 --> 00:02:28.910
I wanna be your light
(More than I am now)

00:02:28.910 --> 00:02:34.250
Someday I'll share with you
my 100% smile

00:02:54.800 --> 00:02:55.460
Ketsu!

00:02:57.640 --> 00:02:58.300
Ketsu!

00:03:12.520 --> 00:03:14.390
I thought I finally
found Yoshimori.

00:03:15.320 --> 00:03:18.620
I better go catch him
and get out of here.

00:03:22.660 --> 00:03:23.320
A human?

00:03:23.700 --> 00:03:24.690
An Ayakashi?!

00:03:30.770 --> 00:03:31.430
Jump!

00:03:42.750 --> 00:03:43.740
Come with me!

00:03:52.990 --> 00:03:56.050
Damn it!
I said it was dangerous here.

00:03:56.800 --> 00:03:58.600
What do you want me to do?!

00:03:58.830 --> 00:04:01.030
I can't tag along
with idiots anymore!

00:04:05.340 --> 00:04:08.830
I wouldn't care if it was just me.

00:04:10.110 --> 00:04:13.050
I'm worried about Yoshimori...

00:04:14.050 --> 00:04:17.780
Fine! You want me to
go along with you guys, right?!

00:04:18.120 --> 00:04:20.050
I'll find both of you!

00:04:27.760 --> 00:04:29.530
What is this place?

00:04:30.670 --> 00:04:32.860
Go. No one will come now.

00:04:34.140 --> 00:04:36.470
Aren't you an Ayakashi
of the Kokuboro?

00:04:36.870 --> 00:04:38.860
Why are you helping me?

00:04:41.280 --> 00:04:42.270
I don't know.

00:04:42.580 --> 00:04:44.740
It's been a long time
since I smelled a human.

00:04:44.780 --> 00:04:45.770
It must be messing with my mind.

00:04:47.580 --> 00:04:49.020
It was the same with that man...

00:04:50.390 --> 00:04:51.370
That man?

00:04:53.590 --> 00:04:59.220
A human that I knew long ago.
He also risked his life for others.

00:05:00.090 --> 00:05:02.820
Though he was an ordinary,
yet sickly man...

00:05:07.940 --> 00:05:10.670
A-Ayakashi! It's an Ayakashi!

00:05:20.680 --> 00:05:25.140
You're in luck, human.
I'm not hungry right now.

00:05:25.750 --> 00:05:27.950
I'll let you go,
so do not speak to anyone about me.

00:05:30.660 --> 00:05:31.850
W-Wait!

00:05:33.900 --> 00:05:37.260
If I come here,
will I be able to see you again?

00:05:42.670 --> 00:05:45.230
There you are!
Ayakashi!

00:05:46.410 --> 00:05:47.810
Hey, Ayakashi!

00:05:51.710 --> 00:05:53.010
Hey, Ayakashi.

00:05:53.550 --> 00:05:54.570
Want some buns?

00:05:55.220 --> 00:05:57.490
How many times do I have to
tell you that I'll eat you

00:05:57.490 --> 00:05:58.750
the next time you come here?

00:05:59.350 --> 00:06:00.510
You can eat me if you want.

00:06:03.320 --> 00:06:05.190
I've never met a human like you.

00:06:05.860 --> 00:06:07.590
I'm so disgusted that
I don't even feel like eating you.

00:06:08.060 --> 00:06:11.290
Oh, really?
Then can you tell me your name?

00:06:12.330 --> 00:06:13.430
Don't press your luck.

00:06:13.900 --> 00:06:16.870
I'm not the only Ayakashi
that lives in this forest.

00:06:17.310 --> 00:06:20.540
That's all right. I'm studying
how to ward off evil spirits.

00:06:21.140 --> 00:06:23.980
I don't have anything to do
during the day anyway.

00:06:25.080 --> 00:06:27.270
I've been sickly all my life.

00:06:28.580 --> 00:06:31.140
My family refuses to
let me do any work.

00:06:32.050 --> 00:06:33.080
I just eat and sleep every day.

00:06:33.450 --> 00:06:36.980
It may be a comfortable life,
but no one depends on me.

00:06:37.260 --> 00:06:38.280
No one cares for me, either.

00:06:39.360 --> 00:06:42.260
It doesn't matter whether or not
I am in that house.

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:47.160
Can I come see you again?

00:06:48.440 --> 00:06:50.930
The nights are too long
when I can't sleep.

00:07:00.310 --> 00:07:03.110
I've been feeling
very sick recently.

00:07:04.320 --> 00:07:07.620
I don't think I can
leave the house anymore.

00:07:11.360 --> 00:07:12.350
A spell?

00:07:12.560 --> 00:07:15.830
What are you doing?!
Let go! Let me go!

00:07:16.260 --> 00:07:19.430
Please come to my house!
Please!

00:07:19.600 --> 00:07:20.260
What?

00:07:20.400 --> 00:07:24.200
I'm too weak! I probably
can't come here anymore!

00:07:26.070 --> 00:07:31.410
If I can't see you, I'd rather die!
Eat me! Eat me right now!

00:07:39.590 --> 00:07:42.720
Oh, dad.
Sleeping at his desk again.

00:07:43.390 --> 00:07:46.690
He's old now. He should just let
my brother take care of things.

00:07:47.090 --> 00:07:48.720
Oh, don't eat him.

00:07:48.760 --> 00:07:50.030
His meat is probably tough
and stringy. Not tasty at all!

00:07:51.000 --> 00:07:52.430
These girls are
our live-in employees.

00:07:52.500 --> 00:07:53.990
They're all good, hard workers.

00:07:54.300 --> 00:07:57.330
They might still fatten up,
so don't eat them yet.

00:07:57.870 --> 00:08:00.670
Oh, and there are also
my little brother and sister...

00:08:00.910 --> 00:08:01.900
That's enough.

00:08:02.110 --> 00:08:05.240
You're only introducing them to me
so I won't eat them.

00:08:06.050 --> 00:08:06.710
I'm going back.

00:08:07.650 --> 00:08:08.310
Wait!

00:08:25.000 --> 00:08:28.940
It's no use.
Only I can remove those charms.

00:08:29.440 --> 00:08:31.230
You can't leave this house anymore.

00:08:31.970 --> 00:08:32.960
You...

00:08:33.070 --> 00:08:35.070
You wouldn't stay otherwise.

00:08:36.480 --> 00:08:39.450
I'll die in about a year.

00:08:40.010 --> 00:08:42.280
A year's not much
time to you, right?

00:08:43.280 --> 00:08:45.280
If you want to leave this place,
eat me.

00:08:45.720 --> 00:08:47.780
That'll break the spell.

00:08:48.960 --> 00:08:51.790
I can't stand another lonely night.

00:09:03.240 --> 00:09:06.040
I stayed at that man's house
as he wished.

00:09:07.070 --> 00:09:08.980
My life there was ordinary,

00:09:08.980 --> 00:09:11.740
and it merely confirmed
that humans were foolish beings.

00:09:15.520 --> 00:09:17.380
Hey, Ayakashi. You're up?

00:09:19.720 --> 00:09:23.050
No! Don't appear in that form!

00:09:25.030 --> 00:09:26.020
Shut up.

00:09:27.900 --> 00:09:35.030
Hey, I got this kimono for you.
I stole it from our store.

00:09:35.570 --> 00:09:37.900
Wear it for me! Wear it!

00:09:40.580 --> 00:09:43.410
I keep telling you to stop that!

00:09:45.010 --> 00:09:46.240
You're beautiful.

00:09:46.850 --> 00:09:50.440
The man's soft voice...
his bright smile...

00:09:51.650 --> 00:09:52.850
The only side of humans I knew

00:09:52.850 --> 00:09:55.250
were their screams of horror
and their fearful faces.

00:09:55.790 --> 00:09:58.280
But seeing him like that
gave me inner peace.

00:10:01.060 --> 00:10:02.700
Before I knew it...

00:10:02.700 --> 00:10:07.660
I felt I wanted to stay
by his side forever.

00:10:20.580 --> 00:10:21.740
Did someone die?

00:10:23.220 --> 00:10:24.210
My older brother.

00:10:25.220 --> 00:10:29.660
He was strong, so he had
inherited the family business.

00:10:30.590 --> 00:10:31.580
Why did he have to?

00:10:33.730 --> 00:10:37.320
I'm sorry, Ayakashi.
I can't die anymore.

00:10:40.600 --> 00:10:43.900
From that day on, he started working
like a completely different person.

00:10:44.840 --> 00:10:47.430
He said he had to
support his family.

00:10:48.180 --> 00:10:49.640
He said that he was
the only one that could do it.

00:10:50.010 --> 00:10:52.310
All the while,
pushing his already sickly body.

00:11:02.660 --> 00:11:04.490
He doesn't have trouble
sleeping anymore.

00:11:22.740 --> 00:11:23.840
It was a mystery.

00:11:24.580 --> 00:11:28.280
The weak man who couldn't
do anything for himself...

00:11:28.280 --> 00:11:31.340
why did he work so hard
just for the sake of others?

00:11:32.550 --> 00:11:36.820
I wanted to know what
drove him to do that.

00:11:48.700 --> 00:11:51.640
I began to study humans
using all sorts of methods.

00:11:52.770 --> 00:11:56.040
I researched their ecology,
their body structure,

00:11:56.040 --> 00:11:58.670
and tried to understand
what drove them to become stronger.

00:11:59.680 --> 00:12:05.550
I tried to understand
the bonds between humans...

00:12:06.820 --> 00:12:08.450
You loved that man.

00:12:13.960 --> 00:12:14.950
Go now.

00:12:15.460 --> 00:12:17.060
Hurry up and leave this place.

00:12:18.400 --> 00:12:20.370
Before I kill you.

00:12:29.910 --> 00:12:31.140
Sad memories...

00:12:32.750 --> 00:12:35.010
It's the same for everyone,
human or Ayakashi.

00:12:47.830 --> 00:12:48.920
Sumimura!

00:12:52.270 --> 00:12:54.390
What? You're still here?

00:12:54.670 --> 00:12:56.140
"Still here?" Thanks a lot!

00:12:56.170 --> 00:12:59.160
After I came all this way
to tell you about that girl!

00:12:59.810 --> 00:13:00.900
That girl?

00:13:01.140 --> 00:13:05.440
That Yukimura girl.
She's here to find you!

00:13:05.680 --> 00:13:07.310
You probably didn't know.

00:13:07.550 --> 00:13:11.010
Tokine is here?
Where?! Where is she?!

00:13:11.250 --> 00:13:12.240
Say it!

00:13:14.720 --> 00:13:16.620
She fell...

00:13:16.890 --> 00:13:17.880
She fell?

00:13:18.190 --> 00:13:20.890
I think she's somewhere
at the bottom...

00:13:21.500 --> 00:13:22.480
The bottom?!

00:13:25.870 --> 00:13:28.630
Wait! Hey, wait!

00:13:31.340 --> 00:13:33.810
I got left behind again!

00:13:35.740 --> 00:13:36.730
Tokine!

00:13:52.490 --> 00:13:54.980
That was an interesting story.

00:13:56.060 --> 00:14:00.000
So this is the face of the man
that kept you as a pet.

00:14:00.700 --> 00:14:03.190
Get out of my way, Kaguro.
I'm in a hurry.

00:14:06.610 --> 00:14:11.280
The crumbling Ayakashi castle of
the Kokuboro. How nice.

00:14:11.280 --> 00:14:13.110
I love the sound of destruction.

00:14:13.780 --> 00:14:16.980
I don't have the time to deal
with your sentimentality.

00:14:17.790 --> 00:14:23.990
I think it would be beautiful if you
died in the castle as a prisoner,

00:14:23.990 --> 00:14:26.390
while thinking of
the human you loved!

00:14:30.660 --> 00:14:32.760
I've always felt something strange
about you.

00:14:33.870 --> 00:14:36.970
You say humans are
just research subjects,

00:14:36.970 --> 00:14:39.910
but I felt desperation
from you.

00:14:46.450 --> 00:14:48.940
It was unrequited love!
How sad.

00:14:49.680 --> 00:14:54.850
But I bet you found nothing
even after making these things.

00:14:54.960 --> 00:14:56.250
What a waste.

00:15:02.760 --> 00:15:04.230
You're making me angry.

00:15:05.430 --> 00:15:08.300
I've always wanted to fight you.

00:15:09.640 --> 00:15:10.730
You'll regret it.

00:15:12.870 --> 00:15:15.030
Can't wait.

00:15:40.400 --> 00:15:42.800
So that's your true form.

00:15:44.470 --> 00:15:45.770
You're beautiful.

00:15:52.180 --> 00:15:55.640
I can guess how you felt.

00:15:57.120 --> 00:15:58.810
It confused you, didn't it?

00:15:59.150 --> 00:16:00.750
You only thought
of humans as food,

00:16:00.790 --> 00:16:03.220
but you began to harbor
special feelings for them.

00:16:05.390 --> 00:16:08.660
You researched and
tried to logically

00:16:08.700 --> 00:16:12.300
find a reason that
would satisfy you...

00:16:12.300 --> 00:16:14.860
the reason why you fell in love
with your food.

00:16:15.370 --> 00:16:19.770
Aihi, in the end you wanted to
become human, didn't you?

00:16:20.570 --> 00:16:23.370
To be the same as
that man you loved.

00:16:25.450 --> 00:16:26.110
No!

00:16:29.850 --> 00:16:32.180
Now that you've transformed,
I can tell for sure.

00:16:35.120 --> 00:16:39.290
You're a high level Ayakashi
with intelligence and power.

00:16:39.690 --> 00:16:41.490
Did your pride get in the way?

00:16:42.160 --> 00:16:45.800
Kaguro, no matter
how strong you are...

00:16:45.800 --> 00:16:48.100
you're still young and small.

00:16:48.940 --> 00:16:50.060
You cannot win.

00:16:50.840 --> 00:16:54.170
You haven't eaten
any humans in years, huh?

00:16:54.740 --> 00:16:57.340
I can't feel anything sinister
in your aura!

00:17:04.050 --> 00:17:07.280
Simply slashing won't
damage me.

00:17:09.160 --> 00:17:10.750
I can regenerate-

00:17:11.890 --> 00:17:14.920
What?! I can't regenerate
from the cuts!

00:17:19.900 --> 00:17:21.060
So it's the swords.

00:17:22.540 --> 00:17:24.090
But it's not a problem.

00:17:25.240 --> 00:17:27.610
I can just extend the other parts!

00:17:36.120 --> 00:17:41.880
I'll cut it all up! Your memories,
your obsession, and even you!

00:17:47.230 --> 00:17:50.420
Oh... now I understand a little.

00:17:52.270 --> 00:17:53.930
You're insecure too.

00:17:55.040 --> 00:17:56.940
You can forget about your troubles

00:17:56.940 --> 00:17:59.370
if you continue to cut
everything around you.

00:18:00.470 --> 00:18:05.810
Kaguro, don't you think
the room has gotten smaller?

00:18:16.960 --> 00:18:17.950
What?

00:18:18.560 --> 00:18:20.290
I can't move.

00:18:26.270 --> 00:18:31.070
So what happened to
that man you loved?

00:18:31.840 --> 00:18:35.040
I don't know.
It does not concern me.

00:18:38.050 --> 00:18:39.840
You couldn't even
bring yourself to eat him.

00:18:59.300 --> 00:19:00.930
You disappoint me.

00:19:01.540 --> 00:19:04.000
I took your attacks on purpose,

00:19:04.040 --> 00:19:05.800
but you weren't
as good as I expected.

00:19:07.070 --> 00:19:09.630
Don't use half-hearted attacks
like illusions.

00:19:10.210 --> 00:19:13.440
What I want is more
direct and painful.

00:19:14.380 --> 00:19:17.110
Ayakashi that become kind
will only grow weak.

00:19:24.260 --> 00:19:27.280
I found something better.

00:19:28.330 --> 00:19:29.490
I'm done with you.

00:19:32.330 --> 00:19:37.330
He's a determined youngster.
He's here to avenge his friend.

00:19:37.870 --> 00:19:40.400
He really wants to defeat me.

00:19:41.310 --> 00:19:43.710
Humans are so stupid,
don't you think?

00:19:44.710 --> 00:19:45.800
Humans...

00:19:47.150 --> 00:19:48.410
Kaguro...

00:19:50.120 --> 00:19:51.810
We are weak.

00:19:53.450 --> 00:19:56.250
You can stay in your cage
until you die.

00:20:02.930 --> 00:20:05.830
I yearned for what you despise.

00:20:10.400 --> 00:20:12.200
These "weak humans"

00:20:12.240 --> 00:20:17.300
can create bonds with whomever
they want, as much as they want.

00:20:18.380 --> 00:20:23.110
You're insecure too, aren't you?
Because we have nothing.

00:20:31.860 --> 00:20:33.380
We have nothing at all.

00:21:20.240 --> 00:21:23.210
Great Grandpa!
Here's a pretty flower!

00:21:23.440 --> 00:21:25.240
Thank you.

00:21:35.260 --> 00:21:36.450
Welcome home!

00:22:10.490 --> 00:22:11.790
Tokine!

00:22:13.060 --> 00:22:14.690
Yoshimori! Where are you?!

00:22:17.900 --> 00:22:18.890
Tokine!

00:22:23.470 --> 00:22:24.460
Yoshimori!

00:22:46.190 --> 00:22:49.890
With a look on your face that says,
"I'm doing this for you"

00:22:49.930 --> 00:22:53.160
While being enthusiastic
across the table

00:22:53.300 --> 00:22:57.330
Why do you only tell me
dark predictions?

00:22:57.470 --> 00:23:00.930
It's a meaningless
use of language.

00:23:01.170 --> 00:23:04.740
Trying to avoid an emergency,
nothing's gonna happen

00:23:04.880 --> 00:23:08.710
I can't learn anything
(What's going on?)

00:23:08.750 --> 00:23:12.780
You're not bearing
the brunt of my future

00:23:12.820 --> 00:23:16.050
I am, it's common sense

00:23:16.090 --> 00:23:20.390
I can't go anywhere
if I'm always weak

00:23:20.430 --> 00:23:26.370
Train me so hard until I cry

00:23:28.000 --> 00:23:32.700
If you're gonna complain that
tough times are heading our way

00:23:32.740 --> 00:23:34.670
(if that's true)

00:23:34.710 --> 00:23:39.370
Please don't baby me
any more than you need to

00:23:39.510 --> 00:23:42.810
Please Please Please

00:23:42.850 --> 00:23:47.010
Even if I bleed
I'll get a hold of the wisdom

00:23:47.050 --> 00:23:50.350
To stand firm in
this unstable world

00:23:50.390 --> 00:23:54.620
You watch from far away

00:23:54.660 --> 00:24:00.620
It's strange that
I want to hold you

00:24:01.440 --> 00:24:02.730
Hey Hey
